  a skos:Concept ;
  skos:prefLabel "Budget and Projections"@en ;
  schema:category Income and Expenditure|Financial Planning|Budget and Projections ;
  skos:definition A domain encompassing financial planning, budgeting, and projections within an organisation. It covers the hierarchies and processes by which human and financial resources are obtained and managed, including the effective deployment of financial, human, and energy assets to support organisational objectives. ;
