  a skos:Concept ;
  skos:prefLabel "Metadata Schema"@en ;
  schema:category User Focus|Guidance|Guidance on Data and Metadata Preparation|Metadata Schema ;
  skos:definition TBD ;
  owl:versionInfo 0.4 ;
  skos:inScheme trsp:trsp-attributes .


trsp:att.7F192DC5FF
  a skos:Concept ;
  skos:prefLabel "Community Metadata Schema Recommendations"@en ;
  schema:category User Focus|Guidance|Guidance on Data and Metadata Preparation|Metadata Schema|Community Metadata Schema Recommendations ;
  skos:definition A service capability that enforces the use of community-agreed metadata standards during the deposit process. It supports package crosswalks and conversions, enabling interoperability across different metadata formats as a value-added feature within the scope of transparent repository services. ;
  owl:versionInfo 0.4 ;
  skos:inScheme trsp:trsp-attributes .


trsp:att.353453C585
  a skos:Concept ;
  skos:prefLabel "Documentation on Profiles"@en ;
  schema:category User Focus|Guidance|Guidance on Data and Metadata Preparation|Metadata Schema|Documentation on Profiles ;
  skos:definition Documentation describing which metadata values are associated with URI-based identifiers within a metadata schema profile. This guidance supports users in correctly preparing and interpreting metadata by clarifying the relationship between metadata elements and their corresponding URI-based identifier values. ;
  owl:versionInfo 0.4 ;
  skos:broader trsp:att.43ABB27EBE ;
  trsp:hasCardinalityType trsp:cardinality0_1 ;
  trsp:hasMeasurementType trsp:measurementTypeBinaryEvidence ;
  skos:inScheme trsp:trsp-attributes .


trsp:att.568D8C8984
  a skos:Concept ;
  skos:prefLabel "Profiles are Extensible"@en ;
  schema:category User Focus|Guidance|Guidance on Data and Metadata Preparation|Metadata Schema|Profiles are Extensible ;
  skos:definition A characteristic of metadata schema profiles whereby the profile structure can be extended beyond its base specification. This extensibility allows users to add or adapt elements to meet specific requirements without altering the core profile definition. ;
  owl:versionInfo 0.4 ;
  skos:inScheme trsp:trsp-attributes .


trsp:att.5BDCFB83B0
  a skos:Concept ;
  skos:prefLabel "Profiles are Registered"@en ;
  schema:category User Focus|Guidance|Guidance on Data and Metadata Preparation|Metadata Schema|Profiles are Registered ;
  skos:definition A stage in metadata schema guidance whereby a system formally submits and registers its metadata profile to a recognized community registry. This process makes the profile discoverable and accessible to other systems and stakeholders within the community, supporting interoperability and reuse. ;
  owl:versionInfo 0.4 ;
  skos:inScheme trsp:trsp-attributes .


